"},{"role":"assistant","content":"{"title":"Knockouts Kick Off: Who\u2019s Left Standing at Worlds 2026?","lines":[{"host":"paul","emotion":"excited","text":"The knockout stage is here! Eight teams, best-of-five, and the dream of lifting the Summoner\u2019s Cup on the fourteenth of November in Brooklyn.","sources":[1],"chapter":"The Stage is Set"},{"host":"jane","emotion":"sarcasm","text":"Yes, and if you missed the Swiss stage, you also missed Gen.G and Dplus KIA going three and oh, while G2 Esports packed their bags at one and three.","sources":[2],"chapter":null},{"host":"paul","emotion":"happy","text":"But Karmine Corp! First French team in the knockouts since Against All Authority in two thousand eleven!","sources":[3],"chapter":"The Underdog Story"},{"host":"jane","emotion":"curious","text":"They scraped through play-ins, then beat Anyone\u2019s Legend, CTBC Flying Oyster, and Movistar KOI to finish three and two.","sources":[3],"chapter":null},{"host":"paul","emotion":"confident","text":"And now they face T1 on the sixth of November. The three-time defending champs.","sources":[2,4],"chapter":null},{"host":"jane","emotion":"sarcasm","text":"Oh, brilliant. So either the fairy tale continues or reality hits like a Thresh hook.","sources":[],"chapter":null},{"host":"paul","emotion":"excited","text":"And Gen.G take on LYON tomorrow! LYON\u2019s first ever Worlds playoffs\u2014this is their moment!","sources":[2,4],"chapter":"The First-Timers"},{"host":"jane","emotion":"neutral","text":"LYON did go three and two in Swiss, but Gen.G didn\u2019t drop a game.","sources":[2],"chapter":null},{"host":"paul","emotion":"frustrated","text":"Ugh, facts. Fine. But Dplus KIA versus Bilibili Gaming on the fifth\u2014that\u2019s fire.","sources":[4],"chapter":"The Heavy Hitters"},{"host":"jane","emotion":"confused","text":"And Top Esports versus Invictus Gaming already happened on the third. No results yet, though.","sources":[4],"chapter":null},{"host":"paul","emotion":"happy","text":"Semifinals on the seventh and eighth, then Brooklyn. Five million dollar prize pool, a million to the winner.","sources":[1],"chapter":"The Road to Brooklyn"},{"host":"jane","emotion":"sarcasm","text":"So, Paul, who\u2019s your dark horse? Or are you just here to cheer for everyone?","sources":[],"chapter":null},{"host":"paul","emotion":"confident","text":"Karmine Corp. All the way.","sources":[],"chapter":null},{"host":"jane","emotion":"sarcasm","text":"Of course you are. Alright, we\u2019ll leave it there.","sources":[],"chapter":null}],"summary":"The 2026 League of Legends World Championship knockout stage begins with eight teams in best-of-five series, culminating in the final on the fourteenth of November at Barclays Center in Brooklyn. Karmine Corp is the first French-based organisation to reach the knockout stage since 2011, while T1 enters as the three-time defending champions."}"},{"role":"user","content":"Problems found in your script:
